description:
 This is a specially designed dimmer for Cocoweb brand LED Art / Picture Lights &amp; Piano Lamps. The dimmer offers a full range of brightness adjustability. Get full control over ambience and mood levels. Especially suited for lighting artwork that requires a specific level of illumination.
Operations Cocoweb's full-range dimmer module works by attaching onto the Art / Picture Light-included power cord, offering an additional on/off control.
